{
  $schema: "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  extends: [
    ":timezone(Europe/Warsaw)",

    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/homeOpsBase.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/homeOpsApps.json5",

    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/autoMerge.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/changelogs.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/customManagers.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/exclusions.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/groups.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/labels.json5",
    "local>deedee/mark13//.renovate/talosFactory.json5",
  ],
  packageRules: [
    {
      description: "Map terraform registry to opentofu",
      matchDatasources: ["terraform-provider", "terraform-module"],
      registryUrls: ["https://registry.opentofu.org"],
    },
    {
      description: "firefly-iii: tags are `version-X.Y.Z`",
      matchDatasources: ["docker"],
      matchPackageNames: ["docker.io/fireflyiii/core"],
      versioning: "regex:^(?<compatibility>version)-(?<major>\\d+)(\\.(?<minor>\\d+))?(\\.(?<patch>\\d+))?$",
    },
    {
      description: "ncps: review migrations and the pin-closure bug before merging a minor/major bump",
      matchDatasources: ["docker"],
      matchPackageNames: ["/kalbasit\\/ncps/"],
      matchUpdateTypes: ["major", "minor"],
      automerge: false,
      prBodyNotes: [
        "⚠️ Verify everything below against the new **tag** -- ncps's docs site documents the unreleased version, and flags have changed across minors.",
        "**1. Migrations (blocking).** `ncps-init` runs `/bin/ncps migrate up --cache-database-url=sqlite:/var/lib/ncps/db.sqlite`. Confirm the subcommand and flag still exist: if `ncps-init` fails, `ncps` never starts, since it gates on `service_completed_successfully`.",
        "**2. Eviction is off -- check whether it can be turned on yet.** `--cache-max-size` / `--cache-lru-schedule` are unset because closure pinning is broken: `GetPinnedClosureHashes` (`pkg/cache/cache.go`) walks `References` with `narInfoHashLength = 52`, but narinfo hashes are 32 chars and references are `<32-hash>-<name>-<version>` basenames, so no reference resolves and a pin protects only the exact narinfo pinned. Enable a cap only once that constant is 32 (or the walk is rewritten) **and** an LRU run is shown to retain a full closure.",
      ],
    },
  ],
}
